      "text": "2607"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Blakemore Hyde Park, you\u0027ll be centrally located in London, just a 4-minute walk from Kensington Gardens and 11 minutes by foot from Hyde Park.  This hotel is 0.5 mi (0.9 km) from Paddington Central and 0.7 mi (1.1 km) from Kensington Palace."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 138 air-conditioned rooms featuring refrigerators and LCD televisions. Complimentary wired and wireless internet access keeps you connected, and digital programming provides entertainment. Private bathrooms with shower/tub combinations feature rainfall showerheads and complimentary toiletries. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Don\u0027t miss out on recreational opportunities including a 24-hour fitness center and bicycles to rent. This hotel also features complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and gift shops/newsstands."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EKensington Gardens - 0.3 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Queensway - 0.7 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Paddington Central - 0.9 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Hyde Park - 0.9 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington Palace - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Portobello Road Market - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington High Street - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Royal Albert Hall - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Imperial College London - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Marble Arch - 2 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Park Lane - 2 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Science Museum - 2.1 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Cromwell Road - 2.2 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Madame Tussauds Wax Museum - 2.4 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Selfridges - 2.4 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003ELondon City Airport (LCY) - 21 km / 13.1 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Heathrow Airport (LHR) - 24.9 km / 15.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Gatwick Airport (LGW) - 92.7 km / 57.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Luton Airport (LTN) - 51.3 km / 31.8 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Farnborough (FAB) - 61.4 km / 38.1 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Blakemore Hyde Park is Gatwick Airport (LGW). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards, debit cards, and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless transactions are available\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property uses a grey water recycling system\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a security system, and a first aid kit\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlease note that cultural norms and guest policies may differ by country and by property; the policies listed are provided by the property\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003ECashless payment methods are available for all transactions.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Enjoy a meal at the restaurant, or stay in and take advantage of the hotel\u0027s room service (during limited hours). Wrap up your day with a drink at the bar/lounge. Full breakfasts are available daily from 7 AM to 10 AM for a fee."
    }
